  "boundaries": [
    "Selected ordinary variable Short Text/Binary requires exact writable flag2, qualified extension flags, actual complete offset-directory span and exact expected representational value. Invalid carriers, stale/duplicate ordinals and unavailable spans fail atomically.",
    "Span-fitting raw UTF16/compact nonzero Latin1/observed marker-only empty encodings use the existing decoder for exact roundtrip proof. Compression preference never grants capacity. Ambiguous leading FEFF refuses; unchanged noncanonical values do not canonicalize. A span-fitting compressed form in uncompressed-preference metadata is bounded representation engineering, not native writer policy parity.",
    "NULL changes only presence and retains original payload; empty values are distinct. No record offsets, table counts, historical counters, allocation, topology or links change. Required split/capacity or resizing refuses.",
    "General single Text/Binary and supported mixed tuples use actual row key encoders and semantic comparators. Untouched entries retain paid checked wire; replacements recompute complete ancestor key/row maxima. Final full membership/uniqueness/required/validation/relationship checks precede publication.",
    "Causal new test proves raw six-byte three-unit text to compressed six-byte four-unit text is rejected by Len<=3, plus exact Required and EmptyText violations. Disabled-expression public writer success cannot waive engine validation.",
    "Existing fixed/numeric APIs stay closed to indexed Binary; indexed French, ignore-NULL, Memo affected components and unqualified Text/Binary FK/rules/properties stay refused even empty requests. No update-cascade widening.",
    "No original candidate replay, native Microsoft Access SQL/save/reopen qualification, data-macro qualification, ordinary backend/CLI write capability, journaling, INSERT or arbitrary row growth is established by this record."
  ]
